  <data name="how_to_train_body" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Sit comfortably and tap Start.

Watch the mind. While there is silence — do nothing. The level rises on its own: each next one lasts twice as long.

As soon as a thought appears — tap Thought. The session will end, and you will see the level you reached.

The goal is to stay in silence as long as possible.

Practice for just 5 minutes a day. With regular practice, you may feel calmer and more balanced, while your thoughts become quieter, clearer, and more peaceful.</value>
